# name: X posts
#
# # Three posts for the app's own X account, sent to Telegram once a day with a
# # button that opens X with the text filled in. Nothing is posted automatically
# # - see scripts/generate_x_post.py.
# #
# # GitHub cron is UTC-only and has no DST. The times below land in the
# # European working day and in Asia/Bangkok daylight (UTC+7), where the
# # messages are actually read. The minute is off the hour on purpose:
# # scheduled runs queue worst at :00 and can be delayed an hour or more.
# # 07:10 UTC = 09:10 Berlin (08:10 in winter) = 14:10 Bangkok.
# # About 1 min a run -> ~30 Actions minutes a month.
